        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactors! My benefactors! You're alright, aren't you?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, man, you even got tea going, and you still didn't call me over.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#4"
    },
    {
        "text": "I assume these two are also esteemed guests of P'o-shan Village? I'll go brew the tea, and bring some pastries too. Take your time to chat.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.7
    },
    {
        "tag": "playsound",
        "key": "$d_gen_walk_n",
        "volume": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 2
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "And who might this be?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "The shopkeeper here. She's called Dawn. Dawn like the daybreak.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Benefactor, what of those Ink Spirits? Oho, I see! Surely, with your invincible might, you drove them all away!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "\u2014Is that little girl safe yet?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "She's safe. Safe and sound.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_455_nothing_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ohh, ohh, benefactor, how could you doubt me so... I've waded through dangers extreme without shedding a tear, and now I am somewhat sad...!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
