    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1.5
    },
    {
        "text": "Here's your tea.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmm... I can tell it's expensive with just a whiff.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_455_nothing_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "How insightful, benefactor! Plain folk like me could only reckon it bitter. We'd never make sense of the taste.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Mr. Nothing"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's just ordinary tea. They only sell this one kind in the market. Please forgive me if it doesn't suit you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Phhaahh~ I might be used to black tea and coffee, but there's just this special kind of taste to Yan tea whenever I try it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_362_Saga#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "My hometown also has tea whose flavor can be said to be unique. If the chance should come, thou must allow me to display my skills.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Haaahhh...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#3",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Alright there, Lava? You getting sleepy?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Kroos"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm not. I just kind of chilled out suddenly...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_139#5"
    },
    {
        "text": "Tea nourishes the heart. What troubles you can't be resolved just by rushing about.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Dawn"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "We still don't have much of a lead.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#1",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga#1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "In the world within the painting, one can only take things slowly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Saga"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga#1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, yeah! Saga, have you ever seen this thing before?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_1011_purgatory_1#4",
        "name2": "char_362_Saga#1"
    },
    {
