        "tag": "character",
        "name": "avg_npc_144#1",
        "name2": "char_1011_purgatory_1#2",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh? Well, of course I know that, yeah, I'm just wondering why it went back to normal\u2014",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Lava"
